    until the end of this turn); place 1 Zushin Counter on it. Unaffected by other
    cards'' effects. If this card battles a monster, during damage calculation: ATK
    and DEF of this card become equal to the current ATK of the monster it is battling
    +1000, during that damage calculation only.'
